## Anatomy

```svelte
<Thumbnails.Root width={140}>
	{#each { length: viewer.document.numPages } as _, i}
		<Thumbnails.Item pageNumber={i + 1} />
	{/each}
</Thumbnails.Root>
```

## Usage

Thumbnails render when scrolled into view, at low priority, and are cached per document (other thumbnail lists and the minimap reuse them). The current page's item gets `data-current` and is kept in view.

